# Claude Code
# The shared team configuration at .claude/settings.json IS committed: it carries
# the quality-gate Stop hook and the permission rules, and deny/ask rules bind on
# any clone with no trust step. Only personal overrides stay out. See ADR-0015.
.claude/settings.local.json
